  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Defense of democratic institutions and human rights in Mesoamerica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aimed at strengthening national and international alliances to: 1) generate a common agenda between associations of judges for the defense of judicial independence at the regional level; 2) advance preventive measures and attention to violence against women in Mexico; 3) disseminate the ruling of the Inter-American Court and advocate for its compliance in El Salvador</narrative>
  </description>
